  "notes": [
    "One DirectDeposit per item of the per-employee directdeposits route (id from legal and deposit id). A 404 with an empty body means no deposits (D-011). The employee list's directDeposits[] is excluded: never sent live (138 of 138) while this route returned 10 accounts for 6 of those employees (D-081).",
    "allocation_type: amount filled is fixed_amount; percent filled is percent with percent_basis unknown (no basis stated); an active account with sequence 0 ('0 = Net Pay') is the remainder account (D-015, inferred from the label), with amount and percent not_applicable. An inactive sequence 0 account is unknown.",
    "Numbers are returned in full (D-024 for comparison: isolved does not mask them); routing_last4 and account_last4 are null with not_applicable next to a full value (CANONICAL_MODEL 1.4). effective_from and effective_to are null with not_provided (no date field, COVERAGE section 2)."
  ],
